    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Light-Filled Coastal Living in the Heart of Kinsale\nThe popular development of Shearwater Kinsale was built in 2003 and is home to a mix of just 64 residential units. It is a waterside complex, extremely well maintained and in a perfect location beside the Marina / yacht club and Hotels. There is sheltered dedicated parking on the ground floor level with a lift directly to the apartment for ease of access. Patricia Stokes Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to bring No. 36 to the market for sale. Occupying a desirable third-floor position within the established Shearwater development, No. 36 is an exceptionally bright and well-presented two-bedroom apartment offering stylish, low-maintenance living just moments from the centre of Kinsale. The apartment is flooded with natural light thanks to its triple aspect coupled with two corner windows in the main reception area together with an additional kitchen window, creating a bright and welcoming atmosphere throughout. \nLocated on the Pier Road in Kinsale the location is second to none. There is a reason Kinsale is one of the most sought-after addresses in Ireland. Seamlessly blending its rich maritime history with a chic, cosmopolitan energy, this picturesque harbor town offers an unparalleled lifestyle. Known globally as the \"Gourmet Capital of Ireland,\" Kinsale?s narrow, winding streets are alive with a vibrant tapestry of color, independent boutiques, artisan cafes, and award-winning restaurants. As the official gateway to the Wild Atlantic Way, life here is defined by the water. Whether you are an avid sailor, golfer or any sporting discipline, or simply someone who appreciates a morning stroll past the historic ramparts of Charles Fort, Kinsale delivers an enviable outdoor lifestyle. Despite its tranquil, holiday-like atmosphere, practicality is never compromised; Cork City and its international airport are a convenient 25-minute drive away. To own an apartment here is to embrace a permanent sense of retreat, backed by a warm, welcoming local community.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall (14.11ft x 3.28ft) A welcoming entrance hall featuring neutrally tiled floor which continues seamlessly through to the main living accommodation.\n<br>Living/Dining Area (24.25ft x 11.78ft) Undoubtedly the centrepiece of the apartment, this exceptionally bright open-plan space benefits from two corner windows and an abundance of natural light. The room comfortably accommodates both living and dining areas and enjoys a wonderful sense of openness.\n<br>Kitchen / Breakfast Area (17.68ft x 5.81ft) Recently upgraded and fitted with an extensive range of contemporary floor and eye-level units. Integrated appliances include a fridge-freezer, dishwasher, washer machine, built in hob with extractor fan and built in oven. A single drainer sink unit it fitted beneath an additional picture window which enhances the brightness of the space. The entire room is finished in appealing tiles. \n<br>Main Bedroom (10.50ft x 10.83ft) A beautifully presented double bedroom finished with wood flooring. A fitted double wardrobe caters for storage needs, while a large window fills the room with natural light. Direct access to the ensuite creates a comfortable principal suite.\n<br>En-suite (7.22ft x 5.91ft) A spacious shower room featuring a three-piece white suite comprising WC, wash hand basin mounted on a storage vanity unit, illuminated mirror and corner-entry shower enclosure. The dual shower system includes a fixed rainfall head and handheld attachment. Finished with neutral floor and wall tiling.\n<br>Bedroom 2 (10.50ft x 9.19ft) Another fine double bedroom finished with matching wood flooring and bright neutral décor. A fitted double wardrobe provides excellent storage. The deep-set bay window creates a charming reading nook and relaxing seating area.\n<br>Main Bathroom (4.27ft x 7.22ft) Beautifully appointed with a large shower enclosure and glazed shower screen. The dual-head shower includes both a rainfall shower and handheld attachment. A vanity unit with integrated basin, illuminated mirror and WC complete the suite.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Elevated third floor position offers enhanced privacy, quiet surroundings, and sweeping, light-filled views over Kinsale\nPrivate, sheltered basement parking space with direct, secure access directly to the apartment \nTwo double bedrooms both with fitted robes \nEn-suite in main bedroom \nNewly fitted kitchen complete with integrated appliances all included in sale. \nQuality tiled floors in neutral appealing tones \nExpansive corner windows maximize the third-floor aspect, keeping the modern interiors bright all day and flooded with natural light \nElectric heating \nBER C\n\n"
      },
